{"articleNo":"2940","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2940&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 2학기 국가 및 대학 근로장학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.26","hit":"12412","attachments":[{"name":"2011년도 2학기 근로장학생 부서별 배정현황(학생공지용)수정(2)3.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2940&attachNo=1594"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font size=\"3\">2011학년도 2학기 국가 및 대학 근로장학생 신청 안내</font><br></font></strong><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2011학년도 2학기 국가 및 대학 근로장학생 신청 안내를 하오니 희망학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(희망부서는 첨부파일참고)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 국가 근로장학생<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격 및 선발요건 : 한국장학재단 요건에 따름<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선발인원 : 90명<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 근로기간 : 2011.09.01(목) ~ 2011.12.21(수)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 근로부서 : 첨부파일참고<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">근로장학생 선발예정자 명단 통보[학교 홈페이지 및 문자메시지 전송] <strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">(8월 29일 <font color=\"#ff0000\">16:00</font>시 이후)</font></strong> → </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">근로장학생 희망부서 근무 신청[직접방문 또는 전화] (8월 29일 18:00까지)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> → 근로장학생 희망부서 온라인 신청[근무부서와 협의 완료 후 신청] → 근로장학생 선발 확정(8월 31일)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;바. 온라인신청방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">원스톱서비스로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘근로장학생 신청서 제출’에서 희망근무부서 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 완료[별도서류 제출 없음]<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 근로장학금액<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교내국가근로 : 시급 6,000원<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교외 및 전공관련산업체 근로 : 시급 8,000원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 대학 근로장학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 자격요건 : 2011학년도 2학기 재학생, 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선발기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"571\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">대학 근로장학생 선발 기준</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기초생활수급자 본인</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 차상위 계층, 희망드림장학 수혜자(2010년 2학기, 2011년 1학기) </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">나. 정부보증학자금 (2010년 2학기, 2011년 1학기) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">무이자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 대출자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">다. 든든학자금 생활비 (2010년 2학기, 2011년 1학기) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">무이자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 대출자</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 정부보증 학자금 (2010년 2학기, 2011년 1학기) 저리 1종 및 2종 대출자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">나. 든든학자금 대출자 (2010년 2학기, 2011년 1학기)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"59\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"59\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">전국 건강보험료 평균금액 이하로 납부하는 가계</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※건강보험료 평균금액 : 부, 모 및 본인, 배우자의 합산금액</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(2011.1월 이후 월 건강보험료 납부금액 89,700원 이하)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"82\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"82\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 정부보증 학자금 대출 2010년 1학기 이전 대출자(2005년~2009년 2학기)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">나. 보호자 및 본인 장애증명서류 (장애인수첩사본 또는 복지카드)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">다. 4순위 건강보험료 납부금액이 전국 평균이상인자 중 경제적으로 곤란하다</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;고 판단되는 자(단, 대학별 배정의 30%범위 내로 선정가능)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">동점자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">순위결정</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"506\" height=\"64\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">동 순위자 발생 시 학자금 연체자, 다자녀가구 학생, 기혼학생, 부모 중 한분이 장애인․중증환자인 가계의 학생, 등록금 실 납부금액이 많은 학생 우선 선발 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 근로희망부서에서 필요로 하는 학생 우선선발 가능함</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 선발인원 : 118명<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 근로기간 : 2011.09.01(목) ~ 2011.12.21(수)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 근로부서 : 첨부파일참고<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">원스톱서비스로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">근로장학생 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">’에서 신청서 작성 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">희망근무부서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 신청서 인쇄 - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">신청서 및 증빙서류</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 희망근무부서로 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(8월 26일~8월 29일 18:00까지)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> - 근</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">로장학생 선발 확정(8월 31일)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"> </font>\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 101pt; TEXT-INDENT: -101pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 국가 근로장학생 신청자 중 기초생활수급자 및 차상위계층 서류를 제출한 학생은 증빙서류를 제출하지 않아도 됨 그 외 학생은 <strong>모두 증빙서류 제출</strong>해야함.</span></font></p><font color=\"#ff0000\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"624\" colspan=\"4\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">증빙서류 : 1개월 이내 발급분에 한함</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"205\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">선발순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"311\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">증빙서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"107\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">발급기관</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"48\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"157\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기초수급대상자</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"311\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 본인 명의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">의 기초생활수급자 증명서</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"107\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 주민자치센터</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"48\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2순위</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"157\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 차상위계층, 희망드림</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;장학금 수혜자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 정부보증 학자금&nbsp;<br>무이자 대출자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 든든학자금 생활비<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">무이자 대출자</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"311\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 차상위 계층 증명서 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(다음서류 중 택1 :&nbsp; 한부모 가족증명서, 장애(아동)수당대상자 확인서, 차상위 본인부담경감대상자 증명서, 자활근로자 확인서, 요금감면 이동전화 서비스 신청용 감면대상자 증명서, 이동전화 요금감면 소득 인정액 증명서 등)<br><br>- 희망드림장학금 수혜확인서</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 정부보증 학자금 대출 확인서</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"107\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 주민자치센터</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 정부학자금 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"L